From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Meir Dick <mdick85@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 00:39:26 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] media: ov05c10: read VTS only while the sensor is powered

ov05c10_set_ctrl() reads REG_TIMING_VTS for V4L2_CID_VBLANK before it
checks pm_runtime_get_if_in_use(). libcamera sets controls while the
sensor is runtime-suspended, so the read goes to a powered-down part,
fails with -EREMOTEIO, and the dummy-line value is computed from garbage.

Move the read and the dummy-line arithmetic under the power check, where
the other register writes already are. Keep the exposure-range update
before it, since control metadata must stay valid while suspended.

Also stop on a failed control write instead of issuing the trigger
sequence after it.

Reported-by: bprendie (omarchy-snapdragon, HP EliteBook Ultra G1q)
Signed-off-by: Meir Dick <mdick85@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/media/i2c/ov05c10.c | 16 ++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/i2c/ov05c10.c b/drivers/media/i2c/ov05c10.c
index bd83455..5e37825 100644
--- a/drivers/media/i2c/ov05c10.c
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/ov05c10.c
@@ -515,20 +515,25 @@ static int ov05c10_set_ctrl(struct v4l2_ctrl *ctrl)
 			ov05c10->exposure->minimum, exposure_max,
 			ov05c10->exposure->step,
 			ov05c10->cur_mode->height - OV05C10_EXPOSURE_MARGIN);
+	}
+	/* V4L2 controls values will be applied only when power is already up */
+	if (!pm_runtime_get_if_in_use(&client->dev))
+		return 0;
 
+	if (ctrl->id == V4L2_CID_VBLANK) {
 		/*
 		 * REG_TIMING_VTS is read-only and increased by writing to
 		 * REG_DUMMY_LINE in ov05c10. The calculation formula is
 		 * required VTS = dummyline + current VTS.
 		 * Here get the current VTS and calculate the required dummyline.
+		 * The sensor is powered here, so the read is valid.
 		 */
-		cci_read(ov05c10->regmap, REG_TIMING_VTS, &vts, NULL);
+		ret = cci_read(ov05c10->regmap, REG_TIMING_VTS, &vts, NULL);
+		if (ret)
+			goto err;
 		ctrl->val += format->height;
 		ctrl->val = (ctrl->val > vts) ? ctrl->val - vts : 0;
 	}
-	/* V4L2 controls values will be applied only when power is already up */
-	if (!pm_runtime_get_if_in_use(&client->dev))
-		return 0;
 
 	ret = cci_write(ov05c10->regmap, REG_PAGE_FLAG, PAGE_1, NULL);
 	if (ret) {
@@ -561,6 +566,9 @@ static int ov05c10_set_ctrl(struct v4l2_ctrl *ctrl)
 		break;
 	}
 
+	if (ret)
+		goto err;
+
 	ret = cci_multi_reg_write(ov05c10->regmap, ov05c10_trigger,
 				  ARRAY_SIZE(ov05c10_trigger), NULL);
 	if (ret) {
